{"ID":"20240506110130-mxl4ss7","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506110130-mxl4ss7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506110130-mxl4ss7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506110130-t77bkil\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614091823-o6m0ufr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614092027-1nqtfep\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:7,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:7\u0026#125;","title":"354腐婢（观音柴、斑鸠叶、豆腐木）","type":"doc","updated":"20240828102016"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240703180458-vjp1u3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703180458-vjp1u3y","updated":"20240703180458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 378px;","style":"width: 368px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240703180458-fdmhug9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 368px;\" parent-style=\"width: 378px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240703175320-gl1ry41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703175320-gl1ry41","updated":"20240828100146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 323px;","style":"width: 313px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"腐婢"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/腐婢-20240703175444-fcv8n1p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 313px;\" parent-style=\"width: 323px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 298px;","style":"width: 288px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"腐婢"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/腐婢-20240828100146-3tq9wg8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 288px;\" parent-style=\"width: 298px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828100252-0eg1ofr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828100252-0eg1ofr","updated":"20240828100333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 637px;","style":"width: 627px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"腐婢 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/腐婢 1-20240828100252-7yfriad.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 627px;\" parent-style=\"width: 637px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 323px;","style":"width: 313px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"腐婢 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/腐婢 2-20240828100333-3n4upcm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 313px;\" parent-style=\"width: 323px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828100445-yi4a894","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828100445-yi4a894","updated":"20240828101516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 362px;","style":"width: 352px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"腐婢 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/腐婢 3-20240828100445-wcq6y37.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 352px;\" parent-style=\"width: 362px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 738px;","style":"width: 728px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"腐婢 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/腐婢 4-20240828101516-1nn2v88.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 728px;\" parent-style=\"width: 738px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828101614-2bwh3hb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828101614-2bwh3hb","updated":"20240828101718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"腐婢 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/腐婢 5-20240828101613-89lcup5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"腐婢 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/腐婢 6-20240828101718-hlxmnqy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828101808-ytscvcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828101808-ytscvcc","updated":"20240828101927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 619px;","style":"width: 609px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"腐婢 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/腐婢 8-20240828101919-qouhw1m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 609px;\" parent-style=\"width: 619px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 634px;","style":"width: 624px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"腐婢 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/腐婢 7-20240828101807-t0f36d1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 624px;\" parent-style=\"width: 634px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828102011-rljv33o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828102011-rljv33o","updated":"20240828102016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"腐婢 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/腐婢 9-20240828102011-nf68be1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"腐婢4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/腐婢4-20240703180317-2flym4n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240703180207-rm21cez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703180207-rm21cez","updated":"20240828101947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：腐婢能用来做豆腐，故也被人们称为豆腐木。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091819-lxxxa21","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614091819-lxxxa21"}},{"ID":"20240614091934-sagqu5p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614091934-sagqu5p","updated":"20240614091941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腐婢《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614091934-lq21cgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091934-lq21cgl","updated":"20240614091934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛平。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091934-17ujpj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091934-17ujpj8","updated":"20240614091934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主痎疟，寒热，邪气，泄利，阴不起，病酒，头痛。生汉中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091934-pzjol6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091934-pzjol6d","updated":"20240614091934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：小豆花，一名腐婢（旧作付月，误），神农甘毒，七月采，阴干，四十日，治头痛止渴（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091934-mu9pw9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091934-mu9pw9k","updated":"20240614091934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生汉中，即小豆花也，七月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091934-ku334hx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091934-ku334hx","updated":"20240614091934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上米，谷下品一种，旧同。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091955-41nv6ww","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614091955-41nv6ww"}},{"ID":"20240614091956-rb4fix9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614091956-rb4fix9","updated":"20240614092000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腐婢《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240614091956-q3dvqrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091956-q3dvqrd","updated":"20240614091956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛平。主疟。寒热邪气。泄利。阴不起。病酒。头痛。生汉中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091956-cuilj5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091956-cuilj5g","updated":"20240614091956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"感秋气腐。畏日憎花。和羹亦有。饮酒无涯。树寻茎曲。葛引藤斜。草木臭味。群婢纷哗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091956-hg1whrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091956-hg1whrx","updated":"20240614091956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"名医曰。小豆花也。七月采。掌禹锡曰。有腐气故名。齐民要术。豆花憎见日。见日则黄烂根焦。诗。亦有和羹。心镜。治诸疾用花同豉汁。五味煮羹食。千金方。加葛花等分。水调服。饮酒不醉。陶弘景曰。海边小树。状如栀子。茎叶多曲。气臭腐。能疗疟。土人呼为腐婢。苏恭曰。腐婢相承。以为葛花。消酒大胜。左传。譬于草木。君之臭味也。史记世家。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091956-m2wtx6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091956-m2wtx6f","updated":"20240614091956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桓子叹曰。夫子罪我。以群婢故也。元好问诗。不来坚坐看纷哗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091945-n9peyvy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614091945-n9peyvy"}},{"ID":"20240614091946-mzxy3h5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614091946-mzxy3h5","updated":"20240614091951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腐婢《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614091946-v9y3q96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091946-v9y3q96","updated":"20240614091946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛平，无毒。主 疟寒热，邪气泻痢，阴不起，止消渴病，酒头痛。生汉中，即小豆花也，七月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091819-s9side1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614091819-s9side1"}},{"ID":"20240614091851-ht1xaer","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614091851-ht1xaer","updated":"20240614091859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腐婢《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240614091851-nxs6pc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091851-nxs6pc4","updated":"20240614091851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛平，主痎疟，寒热邪气，泄利，阴不起，病酒，头痛，生汉中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091851-d5k8ogi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091851-d5k8ogi","updated":"20240614091851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"感秋气腐，畏日憎花，和羹亦有，饮酒无涯，树寻茎曲，葛引藤斜，草木臭味，群婢纷哗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091851-shm086y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091851-shm086y","updated":"20240614091851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"名医曰：小豆花也，七月采。掌禹锡曰：有腐气，故名。齐民要术：豆花憎见日，见日则黄烂根焦。诗：亦有和羹。心镜：治诸疾用花同豉汁，五味煮羹食。千金方：加葛花等分，水调服，饮酒不醉。陶宏景曰：海边小树，状如栀子，茎叶多曲，气臭腐，能疗疟，土人呼为腐婢。苏恭曰：腐婢相承，以为葛花，消酒大胜。左传：譬于草木，君之臭味也。史记世家：桓子叹曰，夫子罪我，以群婢故也。元好问诗：不来坚坐看纷哗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614092009-49iwhnv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614092009-49iwhnv"}},{"ID":"20240614092010-q698s4b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614092010-q698s4b","updated":"20240614092019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腐婢《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614092010-7dtr849","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092010-7dtr849","updated":"20240614092014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（《本经》下品）【集解】《别录》曰∶腐婢生汉中，小豆花也。七月采之，阴干四十日。弘景曰∶花与实异用，故不同品。方家不用。未解何故有腐婢之名？《本经》不言是小豆花，《别录》乃云，未审是否？今海边有小树，状如栀子，茎条多曲，气似腐臭。土人呼为腐婢，疗疟有效。以酒渍皮服，疗心腹疾。此当是真，此条应入木部也。恭曰∶腐婢，相承以为葛花。葛花消酒大胜，而小豆全无此效，当以葛花为真。禹锡曰∶按∶《别本》云∶小豆花亦有腐气。与葛花同服，饮酒不醉。与《本经》治酒病相合。陶、苏二说并非。甄权曰∶腐婢即赤小豆花也。颂曰∶海边小树、葛花、赤小豆花，三物皆有腐婢之名，名同物异也。宗曰∶腐婢既在谷部，豆花为是，不必多辩。时珍曰∶葛花已见本条。小豆能利小便，治热中，下气止渴，与腐婢主疗相同，其为豆花无疑。但小豆有数种，甄氏《药性论》独指为赤小豆，今姑从之。【气味】辛，平，无毒。【主治】疟，寒热邪气，泄痢，阴不起。止消渴。病酒头痛（《本经》。《心镜》云∶上证，用花同豉汁五味，煮羹食之）。消酒毒，明目，下水气，治小儿丹毒热肿，散气满不能食，煮一顿食之（《药性》）。治热中积热，痔下血（时珍。《宣明》葛花丸中用之）。【附方】新二。饮酒不醉∶小豆花、叶，阴干百日为末，水服方寸匕。或加葛花等分。（《千金》）。疔疮恶肿∶小豆花末，敷之。（《普济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614092025-dvg1rgx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614092025-dvg1rgx"}},{"ID":"20240614092027-1nqtfep","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614092027-1nqtfep","updated":"20240614092036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腐婢《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614092027-7ry8nre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614092027-7ry8nre","updated":"20240614092029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小豆花也。生汉中，今处处有之。陶隐居以为海边有小木，状似栀子，气作臭腐，土人呼为腐婢，疑是此。苏恭云：山南相承，呼为葛花是也。今注云：小豆花，亦有腐气。按《本经》云：主病酒头痛，海边小木，自主疟及心腹痛。葛花不言主酒病。注云：并小豆花末，服方寸匕，饮酒不知醉。然则三物皆有腐婢名，是异类同名耳。《本经》此比甚多也。一说赤小豆花，亦主酒病。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091819-ou4a9wh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614091819-ou4a9wh"}},{"ID":"20240614091832-srngrti","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614091832-srngrti","updated":"20240614091844"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腐婢《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614091832-2g0ws3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091832-2g0ws3i","updated":"20240614091832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，平，无毒。主 疟寒热，邪气，泄痢，阴不起，止消渴，病酒头痛。生汉中，即小豆华也。七月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091832-655yn7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091832-655yn7a","updated":"20240614091832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"花用异实，故其类不得同品，方家都不用之，今自可依其所主以为疗也。但未解何故有腐婢之名。《本经》不云是小豆花，后医显之耳。未知审是否？今海边有小树，状似栀子，茎条多曲为腐婢，用疗疟有效，亦酒渍皮疗心腹痛。恐此多当是真。若尔，此〔谨案〕腐婢，山南相承，以为葛花。《本经》云小豆花，陶复称海边小树，未知熟是？然葛花消酒，大胜豆花，葛根亦能消酒，小豆全无此效。校量葛、豆二花，葛为真也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091819-10nkjgg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614091819-10nkjgg"}},{"ID":"20240614091820-lnvkhzy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-lnvkhzy","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：腐婢"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-w1h0lfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-w1h0lfr","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-wrnick2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-wrnick2","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Fǔ Bì"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-2lous5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-2lous5r","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-v104sq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-v104sq3","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-wq0rxfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-wq0rxfn","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-u8da0s8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-u8da0s8","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为马鞭草科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"豆腐木"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茎、叶"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。春、夏、秋均可采收。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-wvgmkkl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-wvgmkkl","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-gv7phe9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-gv7phe9","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生长于山地、路边。分布安徽、浙江、江苏、江西、湖北、湖南、四川、贵州、福建、广东、广西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-vz55kln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-vz55kln","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-h7xhuh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-h7xhuh0","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 豆腐木，又名：满山香、小退赤、知时木、早禾柴、黑毛列、臭常山、铁箍散、臭联胆、狐臭树、追风散、凉粉叶、早禾树子、六月冻、豆腐柴、观音柴、糊拌子、臭茶、虱麻柴、土常山、小青树。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-uzqrvo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-uzqrvo2","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"落叶灌木，高2～6米。嫩枝有多细胞的柔毛。叶对生，卵圆形或矩圆形，长2.5～7厘米，宽1.5～3厘米，先端急尖或渐尖，基部楔形，叶缘上半部有疏锯齿，叶两面均有短柔毛；主脉隆起，侧脉5～7对；叶柄长约7～12毫米，被短毛。圆锥花序顶生或近顶腋生。小苞片1，针状，长2～3毫米；花小，萼杯状，具浅5齿，齿缘被短毛；花冠淡黄色，漏斗状，呈二唇形，有4裂片；雄蕊4，2强，短于花冠，花丝下部有短毛，药2室，基部分离；雌蕊1，柱头2裂，子房上位。核果圆形，径约6毫米，红色，具宿存萼。花期5～6月。果期6～7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-8o0xyky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-8o0xyky","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-xi119kd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-xi119kd","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《湖南药物志》：\"苦，寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-xwpboar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-xwpboar","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《福建中草药》：\"微辛，凉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-qt7xrcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-qt7xrcf","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-0h11ji8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-0h11ji8","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热，消肿。治疟疾，泻痢，痈，疔，肿毒，创伤出血。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-5cil3qy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-5cil3qy","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经集注》：\"疗疟疾有效。亦酒渍皮，疗心腹痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-qcvuo4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-qcvuo4h","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《湖南药物志》：\"清热解毒，消肿止痛。治泄痢，消渴病，痰疟。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-22minzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-22minzg","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《江西民间草药验方》：\"清凉解热，败毒消痈。治疟疾；外敷刀斧创伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-rnuphxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-rnuphxd","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-hb6enjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-hb6enjd","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3～5钱。外用：捣敷、研末调敷或煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-346ymu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-346ymu9","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-3lafid1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-3lafid1","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疟：腐婢叶三至五钱。开水冲泡，于疟发前二小时预服。（《江西民间草药验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-do4ag2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-do4ag2r","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治痢疾：腐婢茎叶（咸根）五钱，海金沙藤五钱。水煎，去渣，用白糖或红糖调服。（江西《草药手册》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-n4ucodu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-n4ucodu","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治肝火头痛，烫伤：腐婢茎、叶七钱，车前草五钱。水煎服。（江西《草药手册》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-q5mk29k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-q5mk29k","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治肿毒：腐婢叶，晒干，研末，黄醋调敷。（《湖南药物志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-jjplr5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-jjplr5u","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治丹毒：腐婢叶四至五两。水煎，待温，洗患处。洗时须避免当风。（江西《草药手册》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-htn9tdu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-htn9tdu","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治无名肿毒：新鲜腐婢叶捣烂，外敷；或晒干，研细末，用蜂蜜调敷患处。初起未化脓者，连敷二、三天可消散。局部不红不肿的阴症忌用。（《江西民间草药验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-11ehnb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-11ehnb0","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治刀斧创伤：新鲜庸婢叶，捣烂如泥，敷于伤处，能止血止痛。（《江西民间草药验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-jjss4oq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-jjss4oq","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治痈：腐婢鲜叶加红糖捣烂外敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-7mr61a6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-7mr61a6","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治疔：腐婢鲜叶捣烂调蜜外敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-3rps5fs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-3rps5fs","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治毒蛇咬伤：腐婢鲜叶、马兰鲜根、星宿菜鲜根各一两。同捣烂加些百革霜（锅底灰）调匀敷枕骨处及伤口。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-b9u6tau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-b9u6tau","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治蜂蟹伤：腐婢鲜叶擦患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-ijzfy6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-ijzfy6m","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治钩蚴侵入皮肤作痒（钩虫皮炎）：腐婢鲜叶、根煎汤洗。（⑧方以下出《福建中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-07ochyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-07ochyk","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-0wmtl6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-0wmtl6m","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治疗烧伤:取小青树根皮或叶，晒干研成细末，以棉油或菜油调涂创面，每天1～2次。治疗60例，对小面积烧伤一般搽药后半小时止痛，1周左右痊愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-2t563oi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-2t563oi","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-pl1z28g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-pl1z28g","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-nh1jbmw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-nh1jbmw","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：腐婢"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-bl9x4dn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-bl9x4dn","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-97tyhut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-97tyhut","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Fǔ Bì"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-cm3tv4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-cm3tv4u","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-akn8thl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-akn8thl","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 土常山、臭娘子、臭常山、凉粉叶、铁箍散、六月冻、臭黄荆、观音柴、虱麻柴、臭茶、小青树、糯米糊、捏担糊、墨子稔、豆腐木"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-gskcqkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-gskcqkk","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-hsk6aiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-hsk6aiz","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Stem or leaf of Japanese Premna"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-kvchgpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-kvchgpw","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-qhm60sv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-qhm60sv","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-jw450o4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-jw450o4","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-l0cn449","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-l0cn449","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为马鞭草科植物豆腐柴的茎、叶。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-9zvwn5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-9zvwn5p","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Premna microphylla Turcz.[P.microphylla Turcz.var.glabra Nakai; P.japonica Miq.;P.formosana Maxim.]"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-xmfwoug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-xmfwoug","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：春、夏、秋均可采收，鲜用或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-aic9ind","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-aic9ind","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-5uaekk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-5uaekk9","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于山坡林下或林缘。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-emxt21c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-emxt21c","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于华东、中南及四川、贵州。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-vxugabm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-vxugabm","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-lh4c47v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-lh4c47v","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 豆腐柴，直立灌木，植被高 2-6m。幼枝有柔毛，老枝渐无毛，老枝渐无毛。单叶对生；叶柄长 0.5-2cm ；叶片卵状披针形、倒卵形、椭圆形或形，有臭味，长3-13cm，宽 1.5-6cm，基部渐狭，全缘或具不规则粗齿，先端急尖至长渐尖，无毛或有短柔毛。聚伞花序组成塔形的圆锥花序，顶生；花萼杯状，绿色或有时带紫色，密被毛至几无毛，边缘常有睫毛，5浅裂；花冠淡黄以，呈二唇形，裂片4，外被柔毛和腺点，内面具柔毛，尤以喉部较密；雄蕊 4，2长2短，着生于花冠管上。核果球形至倒卵形，紫色，径约6mm。花期5-6月，时期6-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-u8lgdmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-u8lgdmz","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-iq3ajyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-iq3ajyi","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 茎枝圆柱形，淡棕色，具纵沟，嫩枝被黄色短柔毛。叶对生，皱缩，完整者展平后呈卵状披针形，长2-7cm或更长，宽 1.5-4cm ，先端尾状急尖或近急尖，基部渐狭，下延；边缘中部以上具不规则的粗锯齿，淡棕黄色，两面均有短柔毛；叶柄长约1cm。偶见残留黑色圆形小果。气臭，味苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-ceeg1l4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-ceeg1l4","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-7elri13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-7elri13","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含有臭梧桐碱（trichotomine）或其喃葡萄糖基衍生物（glucopyranosyl derivs）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-gj2d90k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-gj2d90k","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-8w496p5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-8w496p5","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-vks2yy0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-vks2yy0","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-3p1o6q9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-3p1o6q9","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味苦；微辛；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-ztc5s8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-ztc5s8i","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-tite5hx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-tite5hx","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热解毒。主疟疾；泄泻；痢疾；醉酒头痛；痈肿，疔疮；丹毒；蛇虫咬伤；创伤出血"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-q7foj65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-q7foj65","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-o7j03ct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-o7j03ct","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，10-15g；或研末；外用：适量；捣敷；或研末调敷；或煎水洗"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-3j25a78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-3j25a78","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-p1xtv1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-p1xtv1j","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疟：腐婢叶三至五钱。开水冲泡，于疟发前二小时预服。(《江西民间草药验方》)②治痢疾：腐婢茎叶(或根)五钱，海金沙藤五钱。水煎，去渣，用白糖或红糖调服。(江西《草药手册》)③治肝火头痛，烫伤：腐婢茎、叶七钱，车前草五钱。水煎服。(江西《草药手册》)④治肿毒：腐婢叶，晒干，研末，黄醋调敷。(《湖南药物志》)⑤治丹毒：腐婢叶四至五两。水煎，待温，洗患处。洗时须避免当风。(江西《草药手册》)⑥治无名肿毒：新鲜腐婢叶捣烂，外敷；或晒干，研细末，用蜂蜜调敷患处。初起末化脓者，连敷二、三天可消散。局部不红不肿的阴症忌用。(《江西民间草药验方》)⑦治刀斧创伤：新鲜腐婢叶，捣烂如泥，敷于伤处，能止血止痛。(《江西民间草药验方》)⑧治痈：腐婢鲜叶加红糖捣烂外敷。⑨治疔：腐婢鲜叶捣烂调蜜外敷。⑩治毒蛇咬伤：腐婢鲜叶、马兰鲜根、星宿菜鲜根各一两。同捣烂加些百草霜(锅底灰)调匀敷枕骨处及伤口。(11)治蜂螫伤：腐婢鲜叶擦患处。(12)治钩蚴侵入皮肤作痒(钩虫皮炎)：腐婢鲜叶、根煎汤洗。(⑧方以下出《福建中草药》)"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-wbun66u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-wbun66u","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-v3n3yb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-v3n3yb7","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治疗烧伤：取小青树根皮或叶，晒干研成细末，以棉油或菜油调涂创面，每天1-2次。治疗60例，对小面积烧伤一般搽药后半小时止痛，1周左右痊愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-kj8pknf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-kj8pknf","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-qwaophe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-qwaophe","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草经集注》：疗疟疾有效。亦酒渍皮，疗心腹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-z82kfby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-z82kfby","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《湖南药物志》：清热解毒，消肿止痛。治泄痢，消渴病，痰疟。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-tfdeeno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-tfdeeno","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《江西民间草药验方》：清凉解热，败毒消痈。治疟疾；外敷刀斧创伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-6c34qq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-6c34qq8","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614091820-5yeijrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091820-5yeijrh","updated":"20240614091820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614091822-7tow1yk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614091822-7tow1yk"}},{"ID":"20240614091823-o6m0ufr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614091823-o6m0ufr"}}]}